Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Directors: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Du-gwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Former CEO Hong Hae-in Terminally Ill{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh!\N- Gosh, Du-gwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Du-gwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget your shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.11,0:01:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi-seon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Because I was told...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.17,0:01:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I have little time left...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}to live.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When were you diagnosed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Chairman Yoon aware of this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.11,0:03:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't die yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}told you yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That it's okay.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That I never resented you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What's the use of it?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It only gets on my nerves.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Let's part ways. I want a divorce.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't thanked you for\Nsticking with me all these years,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:04:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}despite all the harsh words...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't mean.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I love her.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I love you, Hae-in.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You were the reason I wanted to live even more.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought I had more time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking for Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, where is Hong Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't apologized to everyone yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Intensive Care Unit{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry for everything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Episode 11{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:06:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I thought you hadn't found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- You see...\N- Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What gives you the right?\NThis isn't your hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're going to see the chairman.\NGet out, since I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son betrayed you and moved him here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so do you still think you're his legal guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd let that slide?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get out myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Emergency Staircase{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Open the door.\N- I'm sorry, but I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't talking to you. Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me in too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please. I'm sorry for being\Nso rude to you all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me see my father just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I kneel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.23,0:08:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to leave right afterward.\NIf not, you'll be dragged out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Father!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Did he pass away?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You wench.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He made you his legal guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's awake now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,so you've lost the power\Nof attorney now. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.12,0:10:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait. Let's call his doctor...\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was her, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That wench harmed you, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:10:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you kicking me out, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Intensive Care Unit{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.94,0:12:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's... wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's her problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The CT scan shows acute brain swelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The brain tumor cells pressured\Nthe surrounding tissues,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and temporarily increased\Nher intracranial pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We should lower it first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Brain tumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you aware of everything\NHae-in announced? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Honey.\N- Then why didn't you tell us? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've told us she was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop.\N- He deceived us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He kept it a secret from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He deceived us when\NHae-in was this severely ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you scheming this time?\N- I told you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no right to get upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We had no idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.76,0:13:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,despite being her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.51,0:13:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Please elaborate...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,on her current condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong is suffering from Cloud Cytoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a type of malignant brain tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike your typical tumor, where the tumor is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,a big lump,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,these tumor cells have spread\Nthroughout her cranial nerves like clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Her case is a very rare one worldwide,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's been difficult to treat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry I didn't tell you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She probably told you not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It must've been a great burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in didn't want her parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to be heartbroken,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so she wanted to tell you\Nonce things were looking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.15,0:15:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Dad.{\c&HFFFF&}{\i0}{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}By the vast and endless ocean{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}stood a single humble cottage{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}Dwelt a fisherman father{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}and his young daughter{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}Oh my love, oh my love{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}Oh my love, Clementine{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}Why have you abandoned me forever?{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}Leaving your old father behind{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by the MRI results,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe he has vascular dementia due\Nto a head injury and brain hemorrhage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The significant damage to his\Nfrontal and temporal lobes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,is making it difficult for him to\Nthink rationally or remember things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, we have no choice but\Nto wait until his brain recovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give him two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean he could recover?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It varies per case, so\NI can't guarantee anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be stunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just heard, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew she was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you told me\Nnot to do things I'd regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knew but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}But Mom,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I just told you I had a serious matter, too.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Aren't you curious?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You always know what to do,\Nwhether it's big or small.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:18:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Right.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'll take care...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}of my business.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gosh, don't be so dramatic.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.75,0:18:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm anemic too.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm also dizzy, since\NI couldn't sleep much either.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It's not like Soo-cheol is doing fine, either.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}We're all suffering here.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- {\i1}What's this about Hae-in?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true? Is she sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt her family knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.24,0:20:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,not even Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He must be shocked.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.21,0:20:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you called?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a small favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He has anxiety disorder.\NIt happens when he's stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's serious. He needs medication.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he took any with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We have some at home. Can\Nyou tell someone to get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's...\N- {\i1}Hey.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Cheon Da-hye.\N- He might faint and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then let him die.\N- Hey, how could you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever call me again\Nover something like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.69,0:20:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'll kill him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:20:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this was why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told to carry this around...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so it'd subdue her energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to be better than her for once,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.65,0:21:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,what if this wretched talisman...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.57,0:21:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,is the reason she's sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.37,0:21:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have carried this stupid talisman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.65,0:22:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What about a talisman? You lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.58,0:22:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that? This\Ntalisman must be powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.33,0:22:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She woke up once I ripped it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.59,0:22:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.51,0:22:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo, I don't think she's in her right mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.64,0:22:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the doctor and the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.35,0:22:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our family...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.45,0:22:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay?\N- I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.08,0:23:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've loved you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.63,0:23:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,from the moment we met...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.29,0:23:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.67,0:23:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I didn't treat you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.55,0:23:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also sorry that I left you all alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.77,0:23:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,with my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I think a part of me already knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.98,0:23:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,you wanted a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.36,0:23:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You put up with us for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.74,0:23:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it's okay. Don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.29,0:23:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.17,0:23:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't say these things before I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.17,0:23:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll never know how I really feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you this now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.85,0:24:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,since I don't know when I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.91,0:24:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.29,0:24:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I prayed more than I had in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.25,0:24:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd do nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.34,0:24:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but cry every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.42,0:24:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,drink a ton of alcohol,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.01,0:24:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,sleep on the street,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and live recklessly...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.51,0:24:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,if you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.15,0:24:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a threat, not a prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.57,0:24:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.03,0:24:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.49,0:25:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give up on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.91,0:25:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I watch when I'm dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So cut the nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.17,0:25:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm opening my heart to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.05,0:25:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I was even scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,in my sleep, in case I wouldn't be able...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.14,0:25:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.51,0:25:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.89,0:25:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.28,0:25:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.86,0:25:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.64,0:26:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Endoscopy{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.18,0:26:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.55,0:26:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in woke up! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.62,0:26:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.75,0:26:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's okay. I know about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Many of my close\Nfriends are renowned doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.05,0:26:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.67,0:26:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I should've told you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.73,0:26:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.98,0:26:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you sorry? You're the one who's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.07,0:26:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've told me sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.90,0:27:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It must've been so painful to keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.66,0:27:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.45,0:27:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.49,0:27:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.59,0:27:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.36,0:27:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.32,0:27:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.36,0:27:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry I didn't tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.37,0:27:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.53,0:27:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.21,0:27:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't know her child is dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.21,0:27:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know nothing about my own daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.26,0:28:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.89,0:28:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I took my pain out...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.47,0:28:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,on my own daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.48,0:28:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever that young child reached out to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.32,0:28:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't hold her...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.82,0:28:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}even once.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.55,0:28:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even I can't live with myself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.96,0:28:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to have a mom like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.06,0:28:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.31,0:28:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.06,0:28:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I caused my daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.35,0:28:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,pain and stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.61,0:29:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.42,0:29:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.81,0:29:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you know things\Na doctor doesn't even know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.44,0:29:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know the cause,\Nor how to prevent my illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.11,0:29:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not caused by stress, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.94,0:29:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.12,0:29:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so naïve?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.66,0:29:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.83,0:30:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.59,0:30:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've struggled...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.22,0:30:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to have a daughter like me, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.55,0:30:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's not all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.47,0:30:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.95,0:30:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.45,0:30:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.04,0:30:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.21,0:30:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There were times when it\Nhurt and times when it didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.51,0:30:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.77,0:30:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.10,0:31:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.48,0:31:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.23,0:31:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.07,0:31:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.24,0:31:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with how you treated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.41,0:31:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to tell you, because I knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.41,0:31:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.75,0:31:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.01,0:31:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.93,0:31:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't live...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.26,0:31:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.51,0:31:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.89,0:31:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.10,0:31:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die, Hae-in. I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.87,0:32:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear Hae-in...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.05,0:32:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.65,0:32:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Luck is only on her side, since\Nthat evil wench is so hard-working.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.74,0:32:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.29,0:32:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.46,0:32:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.97,0:33:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be scared. We're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.89,0:33:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.86,0:33:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, there are many nice\Nelectric wheelchairs these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.52,0:33:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The chairman may be out of it,\Nbut he refuses to be fed...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.44,0:33:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,by anyone but me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.65,0:33:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can't leave him. That's\Nwhy I asked you to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.11,0:33:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We understand. It's only\Nthanks to you that he woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.82,0:33:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the flattery. Explain yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.20,0:33:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he hold such a\Npress conference right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.78,0:34:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We had no idea, either.\NChairman Yoon suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.58,0:34:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've known better.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.08,0:34:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only getting paid so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.21,0:34:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'd prevent such disasters from occurring.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.29,0:34:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, should I not have said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.42,0:34:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"You have no right to say such things to us."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.76,0:34:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"What do you know, when you only\Ncook and nurse the chairman?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.55,0:34:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that it?\N- Of course not, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.51,0:34:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, submit all the\Ndrafts to me before you give them...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.64,0:34:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to Chairman Yoon, and tell the\NPR team to come by tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.18,0:34:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.81,0:34:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you read the news? The public is enraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.15,0:34:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They're sympathizing with the\Nformer management and criticizing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.76,0:34:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one who's worried\Nabout the falling stock prices?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.52,0:34:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The anchor limited partners are furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.53,0:34:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're worried that...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.78,0:34:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the exit point will be delayed\Ndue to the plummeting stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.49,0:34:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it they want to set\Nup a co-general-partner investor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.00,0:34:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We must find the secret fund\Nif we want them to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.58,0:34:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you dig into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.79,0:34:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was confirmed that Jamal Ibrahim,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.29,0:34:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the bank president of LCC\NInvestment Bank in Labuan, Malaysia,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.01,0:34:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,managed the account.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.72,0:35:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he withdrew the\Nmoney and transferred it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.39,0:35:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- How much?\N- Almost $900 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.60,0:35:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Send someone to Labuan right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.85,0:35:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out the next route.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.81,0:35:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This restaurant is known for their {\i1}kal-guksu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.82,0:35:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Try to eat.\N- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.86,0:35:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.82,0:35:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to eat well in times like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.62,0:35:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family relies on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.08,0:35:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to stay strong if you\Nwant your kids to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.16,0:35:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't look up to me for strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.46,0:35:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the pillar of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.38,0:35:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it was my father all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.01,0:35:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt me at times, but\NI was honestly relieved too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.43,0:35:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.05,0:35:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was relieved that my kids didn't rely on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.72,0:35:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter is dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.65,0:35:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and I told her to trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.02,0:35:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but I doubt that meant anything to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.57,0:36:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.28,0:36:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our kids don't look at us that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.36,0:36:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My father passed away before his time,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.70,0:36:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but even to this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.03,0:36:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I think of him when I need\Nto make a tough decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.37,0:36:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"What would he have done?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.71,0:36:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.54,0:36:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,a lighthouse to your kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.13,0:36:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.13,0:36:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so eat well, stay strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.42,0:36:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,hold your head up, and shine your light.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.35,0:36:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.35,0:36:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.64,0:36:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.19,0:36:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the tastiest {\i1}kal-guksu{\i0} is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.65,0:36:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,if it gets soggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.58,0:36:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"What did I just watch? Is this a drama?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.66,0:36:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"She's still foolishly in\Nlove with her ex-husband."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.33,0:36:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"I've never seen someone terminally ill..."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.23,0:36:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- "so in love."\N- Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.38,0:37:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You've become the talk of the\Ntown while you've been asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.26,0:37:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly. It's mortifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.84,0:37:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? You're\Ngoing through dramatic changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.05,0:37:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You were ambitious about\Njoining the One Billion Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.43,0:37:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then your family went broke\Nand fled in a single day,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.81,0:37:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you're Juliet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.73,0:37:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply put, people think\NI'm hopelessly in love...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.52,0:37:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,with my ex-husband, and that\NI revealed my illness just to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.57,0:37:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's true.\N- That's why I'm mortified.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.86,0:37:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There are other things to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.62,0:37:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Such as...?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.21,0:37:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.29,0:37:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought a formal dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.58,0:37:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought it at full price at a department store.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.30,0:37:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- What does this signify?\N- You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.59,0:37:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That I'm very excited...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.01,0:37:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,about your return,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.59,0:37:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but I should get a refund.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.43,0:37:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.89,0:37:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll assign you to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.06,0:37:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can wear it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.73,0:37:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, thanks.\N- Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.48,0:37:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I'm shy around strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.19,0:38:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Given my occupation, I won't\Nhave many opportunities,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.11,0:38:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so come back. I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.49,0:38:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't guarantee that,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.82,0:38:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.66,0:38:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that didn't matter.\NYou always said to just make it work,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.66,0:38:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll say the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.04,0:38:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back before I pay all the installments.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.42,0:38:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And when is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.21,0:38:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.67,0:38:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's a bit...\N- Just come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.93,0:38:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.39,0:38:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.31,0:38:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.64,0:38:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,give you a hug today,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.40,0:38:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,because you finally woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.04,0:38:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.42,0:39:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I became a divorcée who's still\Nin love with her ex in a single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.80,0:39:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this funny to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.01,0:39:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you let that bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.56,0:39:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.81,0:39:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They were pitying me, weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.57,0:39:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever looked at me that way before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.55,0:39:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.32,0:39:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.99,0:39:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dote on me in front of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.33,0:39:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"In front of them"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.04,0:39:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- How?\N- First...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.71,0:39:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gaze at me lovingly.\N- "Lovingly"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.39,0:39:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.85,0:40:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.86,0:40:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.67,0:40:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will you keep looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.92,0:40:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.42,0:40:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your left arm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.34,0:40:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.26,0:40:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.11,0:40:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Sungmin University Medical Center{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.67,0:41:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.38,0:41:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I had something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.05,0:41:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.59,0:41:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing better.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.80,0:41:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.64,0:41:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.76,0:41:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's not much they can do for me.\N- Then return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.14,0:41:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be more convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.44,0:41:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't call to discuss that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.18,0:41:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm listening.\N- I know you're in a pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.12,0:41:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're struggling to deal with the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.98,0:41:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The anchor limited partners\Nmust be burdening you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.38,0:41:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have enough stocks to stop them,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.53,0:41:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,even if they wanted a new general partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.03,0:41:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.66,0:41:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.91,0:41:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.00,0:41:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,are you worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.42,0:41:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I don't feel bad about your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.34,0:41:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Provoke me again, and you'll\Nlose something even bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.43,0:41:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.68,0:42:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.10,0:42:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be why you called,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.35,0:42:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but my heart skipped a beat...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.73,0:42:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,when I got your call, even\Nthough I knew why you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.32,0:42:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.90,0:42:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,how long I've had these feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.20,0:42:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,or when they first developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.49,0:42:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.16,0:42:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.79,0:42:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember why...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.71,0:42:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut ties with you in college?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.96,0:42:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was grateful for your\Nhelp when I was struggling,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.51,0:42:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but you were the reason I was struggling...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.89,0:42:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.01,0:42:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should've liked me\Nback before I did those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.06,0:42:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I only did such things...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.56,0:42:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,because I couldn't get close to you,\Nno matter how hard I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.69,0:42:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you treat others.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.19,0:42:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.94,0:42:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You pushed me into a ditch so\Nyou could get me out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.53,0:43:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so who could possibly like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.16,0:43:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what about Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.54,0:43:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he deserve your love?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.83,0:43:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He was going to leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.25,0:43:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your tumor mess with\Nyour memory? Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.21,0:43:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.17,0:43:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.26,0:43:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.31,0:43:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Must I explain more?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.78,0:43:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you done talking?\N- Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.78,0:43:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still sticking with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.75,0:43:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.91,0:43:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you develop feelings\Nafter finding out she was dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.04,0:43:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,or are you hoping she'll leave you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.38,0:43:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.55,0:44:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you anything\Nyou want if you leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.52,0:44:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really testing my patience, so just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.65,0:44:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.08,0:44:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to tell you something\NI haven't even told her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.33,0:44:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Try all you want. I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.00,0:44:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stick with her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.09,0:44:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.92,0:44:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't hold your breath and just get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.90,0:44:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.48,0:45:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The chairman is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.91,0:45:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You look happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.70,0:45:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.79,0:45:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I, when the love of\Nyour life broke your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.71,0:45:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.17,0:45:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you hurt?\N- It's none...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.59,0:45:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.34,0:45:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always lived a hopeless life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.51,0:45:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No pain is greater than another,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.76,0:45:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't care if I get hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.56,0:45:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so quit trying to act...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.60,0:45:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,like a typical mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.65,0:45:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.91,0:45:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you been picking up?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.16,0:45:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel no guilt about what happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.62,0:46:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to call me, so why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.50,0:46:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I dodged getting arrested, but\Nthey haven't let me off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.63,0:46:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baek Hyun-woo won't sit still!\N- So?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.22,0:46:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I be the only one going down,\Nif the world finds out...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.14,0:46:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,about the double contract\Nand the land investment fraud?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.60,0:46:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you'll keep\Nyour position, Chairman Yoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.94,0:46:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the amount of stocks\NEun-sung's limited partners have.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.11,0:46:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I sounded him out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.47,0:46:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"Aren't your limited partners furious?"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.26,0:46:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"Don't they want a new general partner?"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.03,0:46:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.11,0:46:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.24,0:46:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He still hasn't located\NChairman Hong's secret fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.16,0:46:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you aware...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.08,0:46:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,of the secret fund in Switzerland?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.91,0:46:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Three corporations are\Nfounded in the Virgin Islands,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.33,0:46:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Moldova, and Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.92,0:46:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret fund in Switzerland\Nis moved to Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.17,0:46:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the Virgin Islands...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.88,0:46:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}make it look like they lent money to Moldova,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.09,0:46:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and Singapore underwrites Moldova's debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.18,0:46:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Moldova announces they can't pay it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.68,0:46:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.14,0:47:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Then the Virgin Islands files a default suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.02,0:47:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and the court demands Singapore to pay it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.48,0:47:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The court makes it possible\Nto move the secret fund legally.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.53,0:47:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Once everything is done,\Nthese three corporations...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.95,0:47:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,shut down and make it\Ndifficult to track the fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.66,0:47:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They continue to launder this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.62,0:47:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and finally, they send the money\Nto a bank in Labuan, Malaysia.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.04,0:47:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.12,0:47:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean the secret\Nfund is in Malaysia right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.92,0:47:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, because\NEun-sung sent someone to Labuan today.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.38,0:47:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So he doesn't know the\Nfinal destination, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.97,0:47:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.27,0:47:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,how did you know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.35,0:47:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Many people are unhappy\Nabout the current situation,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.56,0:47:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but they can't express it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.36,0:47:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Some of them have been working\Nfor Queens for over 30 years.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.90,0:47:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Secretary Jang had been\NChairman Hong's secretary for years,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.82,0:47:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he turned down a hefty salary and resigned.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.12,0:47:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Secretary Jang.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.29,0:48:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}How have you been?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.79,0:48:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They told you...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.07,0:48:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,these things for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.92,0:48:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, for the company they\Ndedicated their entire lives to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.30,0:48:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't want to see the\Ncompany crumble anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.93,0:48:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.72,0:48:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this? For the company?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.97,0:48:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's for the company,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.73,0:48:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,because I know how much you love...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.57,0:48:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.08,0:48:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We've taken each of our members'\Nopinions into consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.16,0:48:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've violated your duty of confidentiality,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.58,0:48:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and leaked information...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.51,0:48:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.43,0:48:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to defend our\Nclient, Mr. Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.47,0:48:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. You have no right to\Ninterfere in this internal audit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.77,0:49:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Article 12, Paragraph 1,\NItem 3 and Article 11, Paragraph 4...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.35,0:49:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Administrative Procedure Act,\Nour client has the right to hire...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.56,0:49:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,an attorney to represent him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.90,0:49:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.03,0:49:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to these reasons,\Nwe've decided to fire you...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.60,0:49:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reason for firing him...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.92,0:49:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,is that you received a tip-off\Nfrom a rival company's executive,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.79,0:49:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,who claimed that Mr. Baek\Nleaked VIP information to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.33,0:49:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and you confirmed he got his\Nhands on it by using his company ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.62,0:49:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, and?\N- When did you receive that tip-off?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.15,0:49:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,On August 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.21,0:49:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When did Mr. Baek extract the VIP list?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.05,0:49:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,August 1 and 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.21,0:49:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Two different occasions.\N- How odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.80,0:49:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His intranet ID was deleted on July 28th.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.26,0:49:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.35,0:49:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I returned my ID card, company card, laptop,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.14,0:49:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and everything else that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.85,0:49:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it wasn't your ID.\NYou could've used someone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.89,0:49:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Like whose?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.02,0:49:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe one of his team members'.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.15,0:49:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That means a regular employee has access\Nto Queens Department Store's VIP list.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.40,0:49:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Isn't that a problem?\N- Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.90,0:49:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There needs to be proof that the\Ncertain information was restricted...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.07,0:50:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for it to be considered classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.70,0:50:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone could gain access\Nand download the material,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.83,0:50:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that just shows that the store...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.08,0:50:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't keep the VIP list a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.67,0:50:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The real problem is the embezzlement,\Nand he signed all the related documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.21,0:50:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We requested an authentication to a\Ndocument examiner who used to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.32,0:50:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,the former Chief of Document at the\NNFS regarding those 27 signatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.14,0:50:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The sizes and the details of the signatures...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.43,0:50:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,were proven to be exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.02,0:50:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is only possible if\Nhis signature was duplicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.73,0:50:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't trust this result,\Nsince you requested it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.11,0:50:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's ask the prosecution to appraise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.44,0:50:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For your information, there's\Nno fine for document forgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.03,0:50:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Only imprisonment for a maximum of three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.08,0:50:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.29,0:50:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll make...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.67,0:50:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,a wise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.43,0:51:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}It's me.{\i0}\N- Hello, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.94,0:51:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.94,0:51:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,of Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.53,0:52:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a nuisance to both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.36,0:52:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Boracay, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.45,0:52:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you there,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.49,0:52:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and pay you handsomely.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.18,0:52:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.24,0:52:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a hiccup last time,\Nbecause I was a bit careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.54,0:52:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll take care of it properly this time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.35,0:52:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The more attorneys, the better.\NIt's great that you have us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.52,0:52:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite having different specialties,\Nwe got together to help a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.15,0:52:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're like the Avengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.65,0:52:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm also here\Nbecause people kept asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.23,0:52:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,if you were getting back together with your ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.86,0:52:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.83,0:52:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.33,0:52:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You majored in commercial law.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.37,0:52:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right. You excelled at the\NBills of Exchange Act and Check Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.63,0:53:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the past. I take all sorts of cases now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.05,0:53:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.47,0:53:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and track the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.47,0:53:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}WSB Switzerland Bank{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.01,0:53:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get these?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.44,0:53:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hello.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.23,0:53:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Take this.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.56,0:53:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- I'll throw this away on my way out.\N- Thank you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.90,0:53:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Second basement level?\N- Yes.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.23,0:53:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Secretary Na, hello.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.99,0:53:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hello.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.91,0:53:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Have one.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.41,0:53:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Thank you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.96,0:53:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eun-sung is looking for\Nthe chairman's secret fund...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.30,0:53:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so he can buy more stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.06,0:53:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret fund? How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.77,0:53:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,$900 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.03,0:54:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,to find it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.28,0:54:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, be careful of the UV rays.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.20,0:54:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.49,0:54:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you side with Beom-ja?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.50,0:54:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.50,0:54:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you got the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.67,0:54:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That time,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.21,0:54:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt terrible because she begged me...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.34,0:54:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,to help her see her father just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.42,0:54:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm unusually soft at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.05,0:54:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Side with whoever you pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.84,0:54:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, Ms. Moh!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.43,0:54:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.97,0:54:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I only side with money and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.02,0:54:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you're the queen right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.52,0:54:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be the\NCEO or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.02,0:54:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to stick with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.65,0:54:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,like your maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.99,0:54:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Maid, my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.91,0:54:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.91,0:54:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.24,0:54:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I, the amazing Grace, will serve you amazingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.54,0:55:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, do you remember this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.75,0:55:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They said being in a familiar environment...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.92,0:55:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,would help you recover, so I brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.95,0:55:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to be a caregiver.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.01,0:55:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me give you a massage later.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.30,0:55:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some frankincense oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.22,0:55:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.12,0:55:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.71,0:55:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go and let him rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.64,0:56:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.14,0:56:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that bring back memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.73,0:56:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me. Where's my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.52,0:56:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the secret fund you\Nstashed away under my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.26,0:56:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep watching her, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.14,0:56:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what else she'll do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.98,0:56:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.34,0:57:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.34,0:57:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, he's showing so\Nmuch skin in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.98,0:57:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.48,0:57:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"Check me out."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.32,0:57:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm good-looking."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.19,0:57:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"I have a great body too."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.90,0:57:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.03,0:57:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.43,0:58:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.27,0:58:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.69,0:58:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.52,0:58:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you were peeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.98,0:58:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't. I was just passing by...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.78,0:58:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,when I saw you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.12,0:58:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.29,0:58:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is that?\N- Mulberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.83,0:58:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As in...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.42,0:58:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- berries?\N- Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.34,0:58:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're good for women.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.84,0:58:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- How much?\N- They're not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.64,0:58:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.72,0:58:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.68,0:58:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How original. I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.52,0:58:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.19,0:58:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the first guy to make\Na move using mulberries,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.23,0:58:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but let me be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.32,0:58:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Accepting these...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.49,0:58:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean I'm accepting your love.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.70,0:59:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's your MBTI?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.95,0:59:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're an ISTJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.46,0:59:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- I... What?\N- You don't express emotions well.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.92,0:59:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a perfectionist with a good memory.\NYou look cold, but you're actually soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.34,0:59:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Robert De Niro and\NNatalie Portman are this type.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.93,0:59:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.97,0:59:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.64,0:59:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be working like the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.68,0:59:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't work...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.02,0:59:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.48,0:59:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.52,0:59:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Because life is too short.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.19,0:59:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I just work enough to be self-sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.79,0:59:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So what? He's a self-sufficient farmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.67,1:00:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he save these for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.63,1:00:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.97,1:00:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Natalie Portman?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.83,1:00:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.74,1:00:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.75,1:00:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're from Yeong-song.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.21,1:00:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He picked some mulberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.00,1:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he has more.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.46,1:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He picked way too many,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.13,1:00:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's been sharing them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.84,1:00:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.01,1:00:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He could just sell the extra.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.72,1:00:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He always puts aside just enough for his family,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.39,1:00:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and gives away the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.35,1:00:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll we do with all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.34,1:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone once told me that the\Nwise eat meat when times are rough.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.84,1:01:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.89,1:01:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Determination alone can't\Nstrengthen your willpower.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.97,1:01:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your health matters too.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.02,1:01:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wipe your hands.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.31,1:01:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, think about what you ate\Non all your special occasions.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.48,1:01:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It was meat.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.94,1:01:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? Birthdays, graduations,\Nthe day you got a new job,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.64,1:01:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and look.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.66,1:01:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're celebrating her\Ndischarge over some meat, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.08,1:01:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We always had Chinese food on my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.83,1:01:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's sweet-and-sour pork?\NWhat about chili chicken?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.37,1:01:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me grill it.\N- You?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.54,1:02:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You only eat meat...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.80,1:02:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,that's served on your plate.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.38,1:02:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be grilling my family's meat starting now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.09,1:02:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Put down your tongs.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.97,1:02:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me.\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.48,1:02:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, I remember...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.69,1:02:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the doctor's saying your WBC mattered the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.73,1:02:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He said you needed to reach...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.77,1:02:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,a certain level to receive treatment in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.40,1:02:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.49,1:02:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My WBC needs to be...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.99,1:02:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,between 4000 and 10,000 cells per microliter.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.91,1:02:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How high was it in Germany?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.04,1:02:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It was 1500 cells/µL.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.04,1:02:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so low.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.04,1:02:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But it went up a lot recently.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.67,1:02:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about 3000 now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.59,1:02:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's double the amount.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.13,1:02:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.84,1:02:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... It's not that big of a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.09,1:02:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- I still have over 1000 to go.\N- You're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.64,1:02:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Try harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.43,1:02:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't like studying.\NI can't just "try harder."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.98,1:03:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, what should\Nyou do? Get injections and?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.06,1:03:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.61,1:03:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about her stamina and immunity.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.49,1:03:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs to eat well and take\Na lot of vitamins and proteins.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.78,1:03:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs good rest too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.16,1:03:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she needs to eat a lot of meat...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.35,1:03:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and beans.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.37,1:03:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to plan her diet.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.46,1:03:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Beom-jun.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.80,1:03:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Flip them over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.72,1:03:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.05,1:03:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.05,1:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're burned. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.81,1:03:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We can just cut them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.02,1:03:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can you give me the scissors?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.23,1:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.44,1:03:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So she needs meat and beans.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.77,1:03:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.90,1:03:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bananas and nuts...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.98,1:03:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is good.\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.53,1:03:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is tasty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.03,1:03:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.83,1:03:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look.\N- He's excited.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.87,1:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.96,1:04:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to flip this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.75,1:04:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.67,1:04:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs a lot of protein.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.38,1:04:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She does.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.22,1:04:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat while you do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.31,1:04:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe it off for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.99,1:04:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.28,1:04:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't working again.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.45,1:04:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.29,1:04:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to press this part.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.30,1:04:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not as good as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.76,1:04:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I buy a new one?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.84,1:04:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.93,1:04:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you struggle to use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.30,1:04:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can do it for me.\NLook how good you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.35,1:05:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.85,1:05:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting better...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.98,1:05:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the more I dry your hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.74,1:05:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.74,1:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You did a good job on the curls.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.33,1:05:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're better,\Nkeep drying my hair for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.58,1:05:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. That's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.23,1:05:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.25,1:05:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what else you want\Nme to do, and I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.09,1:05:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.71,1:05:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you dry my hair\Nwith the broken hair dryer.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.14,1:05:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So just this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.80,1:05:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a big favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.47,1:05:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd have to be with me every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.27,1:05:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.68,1:05:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be greedy for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.31,1:05:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, be greedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.93,1:05:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.98,1:05:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try too hard to treat me well.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.36,1:05:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't confess my love to\Nyou so you'd treat me better.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.16,1:05:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was simply...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.20,1:06:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,expressing my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.79,1:06:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.29,1:06:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart wants it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.21,1:06:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do better,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.46,1:06:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,if I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.21,1:06:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.39,1:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.14,1:06:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't recognize Soo-cheol's face...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.52,1:06:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,for a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.06,1:06:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't remember my doctor's name, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.78,1:06:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I also lost my way to my hospital room...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.32,1:06:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,for a minute, and just stood still.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.78,1:06:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When my doctor first told me about my illness,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.83,1:06:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he mentioned memory loss,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.62,1:06:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,sensory loss, and speech impediment,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.62,1:06:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't believe him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.63,1:06:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that only happened to others.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.21,1:06:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was different,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.05,1:07:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's happening in that exact order.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.51,1:07:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can expect the next symptom,\Nand it's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.35,1:07:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.98,1:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to be next to me when it happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.69,1:07:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.24,1:07:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be happy with where we are now,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.07,1:07:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and when my illness worsens,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.74,1:07:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.37,1:07:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,to leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.50,1:07:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.52,1:07:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What? When did he leave the game?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.31,1:07:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.48,1:07:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Deactivated Member{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.19,1:07:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.30,1:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.68,1:08:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that bitter?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.27,1:08:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not as much as my life.\N- Dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.57,1:08:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, please talk casually to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.45,1:08:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,"Master"?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.37,1:08:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please teach me how to box.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.70,1:08:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't land a single punch...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.16,1:08:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,on Eun-sung last time,\Nand fell down humiliatingly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.55,1:08:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.92,1:09:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you suddenly start\Nworking out out of rage,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.34,1:09:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- you'll injure your joints...\N- Joints?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.59,1:09:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.72,1:09:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go insane at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.10,1:09:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I need to protect my\Nfamily in the future, but I can't?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.06,1:09:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dreading it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.27,1:09:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.24,1:09:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.49,1:09:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.20,1:09:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.20,1:09:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.45,1:09:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.54,1:09:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.87,1:09:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're doing this in haste,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.25,1:09:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only teach you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.07,1:09:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.09,1:09:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Landing a single punch...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.05,1:09:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,on someone powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.35,1:09:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two core skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.31,1:09:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.68,1:09:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.90,1:09:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.57,1:10:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I that strong?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.45,1:10:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is the first skill.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.58,1:10:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Exaggerate,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.58,1:10:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so they'll feel arrogant and think,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.91,1:10:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"He's no match for me."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.91,1:10:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"I pretty much won."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.58,1:10:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm surprisingly strong."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.97,1:10:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.22,1:10:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well done.\N- That really hurt!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.05,1:10:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry.\N- My nose!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.80,1:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must I learn this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.18,1:10:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So they'll let down their guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.02,1:10:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You must wait until they let down their guard,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.19,1:10:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,then land your critical punch.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.23,1:10:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But get beaten up until then?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.98,1:10:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the second skill.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.82,1:10:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Endurance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.32,1:10:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You need stamina to take blows well.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.11,1:10:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I can do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.95,1:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Muhammad Ali, my mentor, said this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.25,1:10:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"Impossible..."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.83,1:11:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"isn't a fact, it's an opinion."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.72,1:11:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.80,1:11:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Take some blows for now\Nand become a champion in life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.05,1:11:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your mentor say that too?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.93,1:11:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is me talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.60,1:11:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.60,1:11:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.19,1:11:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.70,1:11:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.82,1:11:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were\Nrelaxing in such a beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.37,1:11:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and clean environment.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.70,1:11:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Relaxing, my foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.00,1:11:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you come here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.50,1:11:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I invited her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.67,1:11:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.04,1:11:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I haven't told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.25,1:11:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about Grandfather's secret fund.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.68,1:11:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,$900 million?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.09,1:11:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And that money is in Malaysia?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.26,1:11:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I think it's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.89,1:11:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- In Korea?\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.97,1:11:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It was laundered in\NHong Kong before coming here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.73,1:12:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That paper company...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.35,1:12:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,lent the money to five\Ninvestment companies in Korea...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.65,1:12:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,before shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.61,1:12:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the five companies\Ndon't need to pay it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.15,1:12:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Father own those companies?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.36,1:12:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he collapsed,\Nownership was transferred...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.91,1:12:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to Ms. Moh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.70,1:12:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.79,1:12:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that wench took it all?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.00,1:12:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.17,1:12:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's still looking for it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.43,1:12:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tell me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.68,1:12:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's my money?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.76,1:12:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's the secret fund you\Nstashed away under my name?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.76,1:12:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure Grace is allowed...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.72,1:12:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- to hear this?\N- You can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.39,1:12:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've defected.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.44,1:12:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember Lee Woong-pyung?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.73,1:12:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've also flown my jet...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.48,1:12:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to this land of freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.11,1:12:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.\NLet's take a look at your jet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.90,1:12:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.03,1:12:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone I know in the real-estate\Nbusiness said something strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.95,1:12:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That Director Jin of Queens Gallery rented...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.70,1:13:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,a 4-acre warehouse on the\Noutskirts of Gyeonggi Province.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.41,1:13:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like they're building a film set,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.92,1:13:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so why do they need such a huge one?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.51,1:13:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think the money is there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.84,1:13:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to bring you all the mail sent...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.22,1:13:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,to the former chairman.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.76,1:13:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.73,1:13:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I could've come by myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.31,1:13:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to swarm over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.69,1:13:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't trust you. It's like\Nleaving a kid to her own devices.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.40,1:13:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You were all exposed on the media.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.82,1:13:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- What if they recognize you?\N- We disguised ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.95,1:13:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take over from here, so you may go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.20,1:13:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hurting my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.42,1:13:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an undercover mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.17,1:13:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever faked anything before? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.55,1:13:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire life has been fake,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.92,1:13:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,so how could you leave me out of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.05,1:13:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.59,1:13:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a real-estate agent,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.47,1:14:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're wholesale dealers\Nwho need a huge warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.43,1:14:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do the talking, so don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.15,1:14:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.49,1:14:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no place to stash all that money.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.36,1:14:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.66,1:14:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,what will they store?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.79,1:14:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Golf clubs...\N- Clothes...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.17,1:14:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He imports...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.67,1:14:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,golf equipment,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.96,1:14:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and she sells clothes in Dongdaemun.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.63,1:14:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's from China.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.92,1:14:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He understands Korean,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.43,1:14:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but can't speak it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.85,1:14:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir. No coriander.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.97,1:14:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't speak Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.02,1:14:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the temperature and humidity in here...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.65,1:14:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,being regulated?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.74,1:14:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.82,1:14:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Our former customers used to import art.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.49,1:15:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a bit about art.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.37,1:15:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Which artists?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.53,1:15:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They weren't famous.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.58,1:15:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They were rookies, but they're very famous now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.71,1:15:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Their works have jumped 20 to 30 times in price.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.00,1:15:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This place brings good energy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.21,1:15:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- No cilantro in my dish, please.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.63,1:15:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd like to see the artwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.03,1:15:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.05,1:15:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, what's become of my child?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.10,1:15:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The main door is open.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.64,1:15:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're headed inside, so check the office.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.64,1:15:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.37,1:15:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is considered a business trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.12,1:15:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you extra.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.50,1:15:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They really shouldn't catch me doing this here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.18,1:16:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the wrong way to store artwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.27,1:16:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say these pieces\Nof artwork jumped in price?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.40,1:16:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.40,1:16:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a good eye for art, but\Nthey don't look that great to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.57,1:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the money is in the artwork.\NThis is where he laundered it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.08,1:16:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So he purchased the rookie artists'\Nwork at a high price with the money?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.50,1:16:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, by ten to twentyfold.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.46,1:16:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After transferring the money,\NI think 90% or more of it...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.00,1:16:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,was given back to him via cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.30,1:16:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a substantial amount.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.59,1:16:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where all that money is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.89,1:16:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Decrypting...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.43,1:16:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.06,1:16:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.44,1:16:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.56,1:16:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too much data.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.86,1:17:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask my clients and\Ngive you a call right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.53,1:17:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.96,1:17:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Office\NPlease Knock{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.80,1:17:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it broken?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.19,1:17:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't get wet. Wait\Nhere while I bring the car over.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.27,1:18:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.91,1:18:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo, that was quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.79,1:18:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.25,1:18:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.22,1:18:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a bit dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.51,1:18:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.64,1:18:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have something tasty before we go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.77,1:19:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.50,1:19:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I out for long?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.96,1:19:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not that long.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.01,1:19:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.89,1:19:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.06,1:19:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.56,1:19:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we being tailed again?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.14,1:19:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I can lose him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.81,1:21:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.36,1:21:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we call the police?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.15,1:21:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait.\N- We should.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.49,1:21:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You were attacked by three men last time, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.21,1:22:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.61,1:23:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.61,1:23:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at these comments.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.36,1:23:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is because Eun-sung...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.73,1:23:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,spread false rumors about how\Nyou were being investigated...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.37,1:23:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,for embezzling money prior to the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.41,1:23:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.45,1:23:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I possibly do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.66,1:23:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hong Hae-in's ex must've\Nmarried her for money."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.23,1:23:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"He's a scammer."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.29,1:23:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"This is why you should\Nbe wary of handsome men."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.54,1:23:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare they curse at you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.79,1:23:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sue them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.13,1:23:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.96,1:23:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Someone bad-mouthed Hae-in too.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.09,1:23:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"She already got a rebound after\Nthe divorce. She must be easy."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.30,1:23:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They know nothing about her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.09,1:23:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"Maybe she lied about dying."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.85,1:23:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This one crossed the line...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.09,1:23:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the ID?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.09,1:23:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Screenshot this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.15,1:23:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a PDF file and sue them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.02,1:23:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't settle or negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.44,1:23:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with your eyes? You're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.36,1:23:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll all pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.49,1:24:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.65,1:24:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'm close to locating the secret fund.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.99,1:24:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}That's it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.90,1:24:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Snap out of it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.36,1:24:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}We have our own movie-like story.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.91,1:24:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}How lovey-dovey.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.16,1:24:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Where's the statue?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.66,1:24:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Da-hye!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.12,1:24:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Scumbags!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.83,1:24:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'd have to check.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.21,1:24:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I can't be sure of anything anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.84,1:24:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I was the one who\Ndeveloped feelings for you first.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.21,1:25:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}So he knows where the money is?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.72,1:25:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Is this real? I'm not dreaming?{\i0}
